keywords The Tome of Divinity, Tome of Divinity, Redemption, Symbol of Life, Duthorian Rall, Stephanie Turner, Gazin Tenorm, Henze Faulk, Defias Script, Tiza Battleforge, John Turner, Muiredon Battleforge, Narm Faulk, Dark Iron Script, Brother Wilhelm, Azar Stronghammer, Brandur Ironhammer, Linen Cloth, Paladin, class quest
